                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay directs Mr. Tower to conclude the protocol, the proposition conveyed in
                    dispatch No. 230 having been approved.</p>
